<title>UK: Stakis to build 12.3 million stg UK hotel.</title>
<headline>Stakis to build 12.3 million stg UK hotel.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scottish-based leisure group Stakis Plc said on Tuesday it planned to build a 12.3 million stg four-star hotel and leisure complex outside Glasgow.</p>
<p>The hotel, in Strathclyde Business Park, was scheduled to open in the summer of 1998, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
